🌟 Community Finds
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;One of my favorite things about this series has been seeing people share opportunities, communities, and resources that others might not have discovered otherwise.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;


The NASA Space Apps Challenge
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;strong&gt;L. Cordero (&lt;a class="mentioned-user" href="https://dev.to/earlgreyhot1701d"&gt;@earlgreyhot1701d&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;L. Cordero shared the &lt;strong&gt;NASA Space Apps Challenge&lt;/strong&gt;, a global hackathon happening on &lt;strong&gt;November 14–15, 2026&lt;/strong&gt;, with &lt;strong&gt;450+ local events&lt;/strong&gt; to choose from when you register.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The challenge brings people together to work on real-world problems using &lt;strong&gt;NASA data and Space Agency Partner data&lt;/strong&gt;. The challenges can cover things like software development, storytelling, astrophysics, space exploration, agriculture, and more.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I wanted to include this because I like the &lt;strong&gt;community side&lt;/strong&gt; of this one. You can choose a local event and meet other people interested in technology, science, and space, and it is open to people from different backgrounds and skill levels.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Another thing L. Cordero pointed out is that this is &lt;strong&gt;far enough out to plan around&lt;/strong&gt;. There is still some time to find teammates, look at the local events, and think about what you might want to build.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;L. Cordero also mentioned the idea of putting together a &lt;strong&gt;DEV team&lt;/strong&gt; for this. I won't be able to join this one myself with everything going on right now, but maybe some of you would be interested in putting a team together.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Format:&lt;/strong&gt; Global hackathon with local events&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dates:&lt;/strong&gt; November 14–15, 2026&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Local Events:&lt;/strong&gt; 450+&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who can participate:&lt;/strong&gt; All ages, skill levels, and professional backgrounds&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;🔗 &lt;a href="https://www.spaceappschallenge.org/" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Find a Local Event &amp;amp; Learn More&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

