&lt;p&gt;Telegram 2-Step Verification&lt;br&gt;
Telegram provides 2-Step Verification as an additional security layer.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;According to Telegram's official FAQ, when 2-Step Verification is enabled, logging in requires both the login code and an additional password. Users can also set a recovery email to help regain access if they forget the password.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This is especially important for accounts with valuable conversations, groups, channels, or business communications.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;A strong security setup can include:&lt;/p&gt;

