&lt;p&gt;Users should therefore carefully review the account's privacy configuration and existing information.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Telegram Phone Number Privacy&lt;br&gt;
Telegram allows users to control who can see their phone number through privacy settings.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Telegram explains that phone numbers can be hidden from people who do not already have the number saved in their contacts, with additional privacy controls available under Settings → Privacy and Security → Phone Number.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This can be particularly useful for people who want to separate their Telegram identity from their publicly visible contact information.&lt;/p&gt;

