&lt;p&gt;Users should therefore review historical content carefully.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Deleting or adjusting old content should be done using Facebook's legitimate account-management tools.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Why Account History Matters&lt;br&gt;
Account history can influence the overall experience of managing an account.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;An account with normal historical activity may look very different from an account with unusual patterns.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Potential account-history factors can include:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Frequency of use&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Types of interactions&lt;/p&gt;

