&lt;p&gt;Previous restrictions&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Security events&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;However, account history should not be interpreted as a guaranteed ranking or trust score.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;There is no responsible basis for promising that every old Facebook account will have better reach or fewer restrictions simply because it is old.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Buy Old Facebook Accounts for Marketing&lt;br&gt;
Some marketers search for Buy Old Facebook Accounts because they believe established accounts can help them begin social-media activity more quickly.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;However, effective Facebook marketing depends on much more than account age.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;A successful marketing strategy generally requires:&lt;/p&gt;

