&lt;p&gt;Building a Strong Facebook Presence Without Depending on Account Age&lt;br&gt;
A sustainable Facebook presence can be developed without relying solely on an old account.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Start with a clear objective.&lt;/p&gt;

