Respond to relevant comments and messages.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Maintain Consistency&lt;br&gt;
Consistent activity is generally more useful than sudden bursts of aggressive activity.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Understand Your Audience&lt;br&gt;
Learn what your audience wants to read, watch, discuss, and share.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;How to Evaluate an Account-Related Service&lt;br&gt;
If you encounter websites advertising Buy Old Facebook Accounts, evaluate the service carefully.&lt;/p&gt;

