&lt;p&gt;Using strong authentication&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Reviewing login alerts&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Saving important business information separately&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Monitoring account-security notifications&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Do not rely on another person's recovery email or phone number for long-term account security.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Privacy Checklist for Established Facebook Accounts&lt;br&gt;
A practical privacy review can include:&lt;/p&gt;

